      {
        "pid": "q7-g",
        "html": "<div class=\"poem\"><div class=\"poem-t\">《登鹳雀楼》</div><div class=\"poem-l\">白日依山尽，<span class=\"brk\"><i class=\"slot\" style=\"width:2.86em\"></i></span>入海流。</div><div class=\"poem-l\">欲穷千里目，<span class=\"brk\"><i class=\"slot\" style=\"width:2.86em\"></i></span>一层楼。</div></div><div class=\"poem\"><div class=\"poem-t\">《望庐山瀑布》</div><div class=\"poem-l\">日照香炉生紫烟，<span class=\"brk\"><i class=\"slot\" style=\"width:8.76em\"></i></span>。</div><div class=\"poem-l\">飞流直下三千尺，<span class=\"brk\"><i class=\"slot\" style=\"width:8.76em\"></i></span>。</div></div>",
