      {
        "pid": "q10-p",
        "html": "<div class=\"passage-title\">坐井观天（节选）</div><p class=\"passage\">青蛙坐在井里。小鸟飞来，落在井沿上。</p><p class=\"passage\">青蛙问小鸟：“你从哪儿来呀？”小鸟回答说：“我从天上来，飞了一百多里，口渴了，下来找点水喝。”</p><p class=\"passage\">青蛙说：“朋友，别说大话了！天不过井口那么大，还用飞那么远吗？”小鸟说：“你弄错了。天无边无际，大得很哪！”</p>",
        "cls": "",
        "group": "q10",
        "role": "q_body",
        "keepNext": true,
        "splittable": false,
        "label": "passage"
      },
      {
        "pid": "q10-s1",
        "html": "<div class=\"sub\"><div class=\"subh\"><span class=\"no\">（1）</span>短文共有<span class=\"brk\"><i class=\"slot\" style=\"width:2.20em\"></i></span>个自然段。 <span class=\"pt\">（2分）</span></div></div>",
        "cls": "",
        "group": "q10",
        "role": "q_body",
        "keepNext": false,
        "splittable": true,
        "label": "sub1"
      },
      {
        "pid": "q10-s2",
        "html": "<div class=\"sub\"><div class=\"subh\"><span class=\"no\">（2）</span>青蛙和小鸟在争论什么？<span class=\"choice-bracket\">（<i class=\"slot i\"></i>）</span> <span class=\"pt\">（3分）</span></div><div class=\"sub-options\"><span class=\"opt\">A. 天有多大</span><span class=\"opt\">B. 谁飞得高</span><span class=\"opt\">C. 水好不好喝</span></div></div>",
        "cls": "",
        "group": "q10",
        "role": "q_body",
        "keepNext": false,
        "splittable": true,
        "label": "sub2"
      },
      {
